00:00:11,674 --> 00:00:14,769
simply check where we wanna add a value, we

7
00:00:14,785 --> 00:00:17,254
do that recursively to dig deeply into the

8
00:00:17,254 --> 00:00:17,447
tree,

9
00:00:18,152 --> 00:00:20,478
and we then go ahead and, well, add that

