00:03:32,194 --> 00:03:34,870
know this identified node is a leaf node

87
00:03:34,966 --> 00:03:37,161
without any children, and therefore removing

88
00:03:37,209 --> 00:03:37,995
it will be easy.

89
00:03:38,812 --> 00:03:41,007
Now to remove it, what we basically want to

90
00:03:41,071 --> 00:03:45,616
do is we wanna go to the parent node

