00:04:37,315 --> 00:04:39,768
we also want to set parent equal to this, so

113
00:04:39,945 --> 00:04:42,990
to the node that created this new node. We

114
00:04:42,990 --> 00:04:43,519
do this here

115
00:04:44,353 --> 00:04:45,042
and we do this here.

