00:04:45,796 --> 00:04:48,361
And with that, we keep track of the parents

117
00:04:48,441 --> 00:04:49,547
of our different nodes.

118
00:04:50,381 --> 00:04:52,417
Now that we got the parent, when we want to

119
00:04:52,529 --> 00:04:55,078
remove a node and we know it's a leaf node,

120
00:04:55,751 --> 00:04:59,582
then we want to get the parent of the

121
00:04:59,759 --> 00:05:02,984
identified node So we could call this

